      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb7c8c20b229d706f4806d7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得、好困……\r\n不，我没事……\r\n我还能继续努力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb67dad0b9115a8e67b88e992de3e46229deff4b7efc9034e19ee6d72acdcd9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01b4a19a2b119953c486598",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行，总觉得好累……\r\n可能是因为我每天都过得很开心，\r\n所以有点太拼命了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "20f6216d63ae6f30869c4665f9ddc4de915b339e3cbab2761aff6b449842af1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e835524aa2dbc0f02f7e486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气势和干劲都非常完美！！\r\n我会帅气地好好表现！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a325e4bc2052a4349845a3ae573335bf904756030c01476efa79c9554032306",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:980b92f4c4adbf7aacf9e8a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在好想快点跑步！\r\n还没要开始训练吗！？\r\n今天的我可是跟平常不一样喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b2fb3b53d207c5671b85384a28c13c226167edc1669f293b8b06a9e75249f62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:823e5cf7ff14be407e65d7ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么？\r\n不管是什么训练都尽管来吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3b30da9ce9156dd0232111379cdffb9da37138fa6fae0d64d1bd05b6f83c4f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a6ab3708104d17851506579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉状态不错！\r\n我现在应该做什么事\r\n都会成功！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0827892999239d0c94a6dd96f152c507dbf091f196ffe1cdcff46048952b5c25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23a5f53901c45d8b18d4d9d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好准备！\r\n随时都可以开始！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f415198571298222d3d8b49157f37c2a618b213bfa5b83954f365435f15a6e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead4238640fba5f6fd0f5e5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一、二、三、四！\r\n热身运动完毕！！\r\n可以开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87030445bba565b18173e042bda8fc69cb2f0c5c37e61f66e9dbc9e9fadf2b3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:789b195a9962cf11fa2a6fe4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉脑袋轻飘飘的，\r\n无法集中精神……啊啊，真是的。\r\n我必须振作一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdea5d252643f680987b304df23def8232c070c7d2c026463564feb9c80f8d62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfa0a7135b628c9de842798b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实在是提不起劲……！\r\n可以请你帮我重新打起精神吗？\r\n麻烦给我一记当头棒喝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "995845eacc23bc26f9d5ff2700acc252fa8a0ccce43b62d17bffd488139d2cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:549056f35d18649f75cb29db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近的纪律好像很散漫……\r\n唔～嗯，这样下去学园的和平就……\r\n呜哇～！无法集中精神！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a5f8ec1fca94f408571e76c703bb47717f3bddf276465047f767b6bfe5602e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
